    {
      "type": "updated",
      "source": "wgmods",
      "sourceId": "7872",
      "title": "Evolved: Girls and Panzer Voice Selector (all voices)",
      "previous": {
        "modVersion": "2.1",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.0",
        "fileName": "Ver_2.1.1.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-07T21:36:26.941Z",
        "changeLog": " Improvements\n1. You can now decide whether to ignore the unique voiceovers of special crew members.\nA new option, “GuP Voice Selector: Ignore the voices of special crews”, has been added at the bottom of Settings → Sound.\nThis option works as follows:\nWhen enabled: The voiceover selected in the GuP Voice Selector will always be used in battle, regardless of which crew members are assigned to the vehicle, including official Girls und Panzer collaboration crew members. The original unique voiceovers of all special crew members will be ignored.\nWhen disabled: Crew members with their own unique voiceovers will continue to use their original voiceovers, and the voiceover selected in the GuP Voice Selector will be ignored for those crew members.\n2. Added a Chinese version of the Girls und Panzer subtitles.\nYou can choose either subtitle version according to your preference, or install neither if you do not need subtitles."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "2.2.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.0",
        "fileName": "Ver_2.2.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-12T11:45:59.745Z",
        "changeLog": "Improvements\n1. The original Japanese voice lines were transcribed by ear. Based on these transcriptions, the Chinese and English subtitles were reviewed and corrected for accuracy. A Japanese subtitle version was also created.\n2. Added subtitle versions in Russian, German, French, Spanish, Polish, and Italian."
      }
    },
